{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 28, :comments ["<b>Your fullness.</b> The terumah of grain, as in מְלֵאוֹת וְטֹבוֹת (Genesis 41:22)." "<b>Your tears.</b> The terumah of wine and oil, which flow." "<b>The firstborn of your sons you shall give to Me.</b> For all sacred service — for the service of the Sanctuary and for the study of Torah — as was later the case with the priests, as it says (Malachi 2:7): כִּי שִׂפְתֵי כֹהֵן יִשְׁמְרוּ דַעַת וְתוֹרָה יְבַקְשׁוּ מִפִּיהוּ."], :book :exodus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:26:51.445039033Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}